# A widget that takes no arguments, defined as one expression that is another widget
# (Semantics ch. 8: a blueprint is a value, and a widget's name is its blueprint).
# Written by Claude on the claude-lowering branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
test mod Tests
use Ui.*

@page: @unit
@page:
    Ui.Label($text=$"page")                                       # 0

@main: @unit
fn @main = @page
